{"t":"Bloody Tusks Quest","s":"bloody-tusks-quest-497ae","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Norcferatu_Talisman_d7d4bd.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Bloody Tusks Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"time\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Time</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2-3 hours</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Bloody Tusks Quest</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">250</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15.10.46b862<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 21, 2025<br/>Summer Update 2025</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>A dark, unholy union between orcs and vampires, giving rise to a terrifying hybrid race known as the Norcferatu.\nThe legend follows a tragic perversion of ancient traditions, deeply tied to the lore of Vengoth.The Rise of the NorcferatuHistorically, the orcs of this region possessed a proud, ancestral warrior culture guided by shamanistic traditions.\nHowever, vampiric corruption seeped into their clans. Vampiric leaders, culminating in the father of vampires Vladrukh, warped the orcs' lineage to create orc-dhampir hybrids. This unholy combination fused the raw, physical brutality of orcs with the dark, life-draining blood magic of vampires.The Perverted RitesThe legend is carried heavily by two specific cultist factions of the Norcferatu that players uncover during the quest:The Nightweavers: These were once noble orc shamans and spiritual leaders. They completely abandoned the light to fuse their shamanistic heritage with shadow worship and blood magic, turning their ancestral visions into waking nightmares.The Heartless: In a display of extreme, twisted devotion, these orc-dhampirs literally carve out their own hearts with crude blades. They believe that removing their hearts severs all emotional weakness and fear of death. They preserve their beating hearts in iron-bound \"Heart Amphorae\" hidden in unholy shrines, fighting as completely unstoppable, emotionless fanatics\nThe Wrath of the AncestorsThe core tragedy of the story is the absolute defilement of the orcs' heritage. When players commune with the Orcish Ancestor Spirits during the quest, the spirits express deep rage and sorrow. They lament that while their bones rested in the crimson soil, they had to watch their descendants corrupt their own bloodlines and let their noble legacy fade into monstrous servitude.\nTo aid the player in stopping Vladrukh, the ancestors require a ritual called the Ritual Dance of the Red Moon—a traditional dance meant to awaken the \"fire in the blood\" and restore a temporary echo of the old, uncorrupted ways to bypass the fortress defenses.Would you like to know more about Vladrukh's specific background as the Father of Vampires, or perhaps the role that Anaztassja Moroia plays in trying to stop them?\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">Vengoth</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Dworc%20Shadowstalker\">Dworc Shadowstalker</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gloom%20Maw\">Gloom Maw</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Heartless\">Norcferatu Heartless</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Nightweaver\">Norcferatu Nightweaver</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orclops%20Bloodbreaker\">Orclops Bloodbreaker</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Varg\">Varg</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Monstrosity\">Norcferatu Monstrosity</a>, &amp; <a href=\"#/wiki/Vladrukh\">Vladrukh</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Gloom%20Maw%20%28Mount%29\">Gloom Maw</a> mount, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bat%20Person\">Bat Person</a> achievement. Ability to use Mysterious Machine on the highest floor, making the hunt more efficient.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Requirements\">Requirements</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Access to <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">Vengoth</a> (completed up to mission 4 of the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>);</li>\n<li>At least 17 <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Talisman\"><img alt=\"Norcferatu Talisman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Norcferatu_Talisman_d7d4bd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Talisman\">Norcferatu Talismans</a>;</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Into_the_Grave\">Into the Grave</span></h2>\n<p>Go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> and talk to <a href=\"#/wiki/An%20Ominous%20Bat\">An Ominous Bat</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33264,31786,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33264, 31786, 7)</a>). It tells you the grave is calling you. Go upstairs, just north of where <a href=\"#/wiki/Telas\">Telas</a> is, then levitate down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33270,31787,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33270, 31787, 6)</a> to reach  the spot where an ominous grave is located.\n</p><p>Use the grave and you will be brought to a room with <a href=\"#/wiki/Anaztassja%20Moroia\">Anaztassja Moroia</a>. She will tell you she is glad you finally answered her <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">call</span>, and informs you <a href=\"#/wiki/Vladrukh\">Vladrukh</a> and his army of vile orcs obtained some preserved blood of an ancient <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">entity</span>.\n</p><p>She grants you her magic to pierce their protection and enter their lair.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Through_the_Mist\">Through the Mist</span></h2>\n<p>Head to <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">Vengoth</a> then walk north towards the <a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Fortress\">Norcferatu Fortress</a>. Do not go up the stairs. Instead, levitate up a bit to east from stairs after the mist, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32914,31451,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32914, 31451, 7)</a>.\n</p><p>You will find Anaztassja again, and she wants to talk about <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">business</span>. She asks you to find the ancestral cave and find a way to communicate to the ancestor spirits.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Wrath_of_the_Ancestors\">The Wrath of the Ancestors</span></h2>\n<p>Walk through the quest door next to Anaztassja, walk east to another another quest door <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32951,31419,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32951, 31419, 6)</a>, then talk to <a href=\"#/wiki/An%20Orchish%20Ancestor%20Spirit\">An Orchish Ancestor Spirit</a>.\n</p><p>The spirit tells you you need to <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">appease</span> them in order to gain their support.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dance_of_Death\">Dance of Death</span></h2>\n<p>You learn that you must dance to honor the rites of the the spirit's kind. By 'dancing' and performing the Ritual Dance of the Red Moon you will earn their blessing.\n</p><p>Walk in the room and stand on top of an omnious mark, then rotate your character as fast as you can. A counter next to your character will start increasing its value until 50. Avoid standing next to <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQW5ncnlfT3JjX0FuY2VzdG9yX1NwaXJpdD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Angry Orc Ancestor Spirit (page does not exist)\">Angry Orc Ancestor Spirits</span>, they will often make your <a href=\"#/wiki/Drunk\">drunk</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rooted\">rooted</a>, or <a href=\"#/wiki/Feared\">feared</a>. When you reach 50, a message appears to inform the ritual is concluded (<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">YOU HAVE APPEASED THE ORCISH ANCESTORS!</span>).\n</p><p>Report back to Anaztassja by talking to her about <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">business</span>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Bloodbath\">Bloodbath</span></h2>\n<p>Anaztassja tells you need to undergo a baptism of blood to fool the wards in the deeper dungeons. Go one floor up and enter a room protected by a quest door, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32909,31432,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32909, 31432, 5)</a>.\n</p><p>This room is protected by a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Blind%20Monstrosity\"><img alt=\"Blind Monstrosity\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blind_Monstrosity_565b2f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Blind%20Monstrosity\">Blind Monstrosity</a>, be quick or use a good strategy to walk through without getting hit by its attacks until you reach the next room to the east. Throw a bomb near the <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Totem\"><img alt=\"Blood Totem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blood_Totem_f77dd0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Totem\">Blood Totem</a>, and get hit by its spells until your blood sacrament is finished (a counter will rise until you reach 10). Server messages will appear to inform about the progress (<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Argh!</span>, <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">That Pain!!</span>, <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">&lt;gasp&gt;</span>, <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You gained the sacrament of blood!</span>).\n</p><p>Report back to Anaztassja.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Breaking_in\">Breaking in</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i><b>Note:</b> This mission can be done as a team, thus work together to collect the talismans needed.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>Anaztassja can smell the orcish blood on you, and confirms everything is ready. Your last obstacle before reaching underground levels is to walk past a <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Guardian\">Blood Guardian</a>, but Anaztassja has a plan: use <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Talisman\"><img alt=\"Norcferatu Talisman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Norcferatu_Talisman_d7d4bd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Talisman\">Norcferatu Talismans</a> to lure a <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoth</a> to break their guard.\n</p><p>Walk a bit northwest, then enter a narrow corridor where you can see the guardian downstairs. Follow the corridor all the way to east, then start tossing the talismans downstairs, starting from the most east tile, until you lure the behemoth all the way to west. This must be done tile by tile, so you need at least 17 talismans to finish this mission.\n</p><p>Once the behemoth break the wall, you and any other player wanting to advance in the quest, have 5 minutes to run downstairs and enter the unprotected teleport.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"w-Into_the_Vampire.27s_Lair\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Into_the_Vampire's_Lair\">Into the Vampire's Lair</span></h2>\n<p>Go to the underground area, and look for Anaztassja. To do that, follow this route:\n</p>\n<center>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-4\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 307px; height: 307px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -1686px;left:-4506px;clip:rect(1686px 4813px 1993px 4506px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"8192\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_8_a3945a.png\" width=\"10240\"/></span></span>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:4660px; top:1796px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-44px; top:-22px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span></div></div>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:4636px; top:1860px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-198px; top:-22px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span></div></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b