an></div></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32881,31428,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32881, 31428, 9)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-4\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 307px; height: 307px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -1634px;left:-4390px;clip:rect(1634px 4697px 1941px 4390px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 10\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"8192\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_10_e4e084.png\" width=\"10240\"/></span></span>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:4520px; top:1728px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-44px; top:-22px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span></div></div>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:22px; height: 22px; left:4540px; top:1776px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-66px; top:0px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"44\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"242\"/></span></span></div></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32880,31423,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32880, 31423, 10)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</center>\n<p>Talk to her on our next <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">step</span>. She tells you she is going to break the final seals that protect the orcish cabal but needs your protection to do that.\n</p><p>Enter the teleport and join the next task with your team.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_Blood_Ritual\">The Blood Ritual</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i><b>Note:</b> It is recommended to do this mission with a full team. In case you fail, you can retry this mission after 1 hour.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>As you enter the room you will see Anaztassja, three omnious signs, and two boxes:\n</p>\n<ul><li>The omnious signs grant players an upgradable and automatic spell\n<ul><li>Circle sign grants a ring shaped spell (ulus)</li>\n<li>Filled circle sign grants a trap spell, which activates when creatures walk over</li>\n<li>Dash sign grants a wave spell</li></ul></li>\n<li>The north box grants you an <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Empowered%20Stake\"><img alt=\"Empowered Stake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Empowered_Stake_1cf835.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Empowered%20Stake\">Empowered Stake</a>, used to deal damage to creatures in melee range</li>\n<li>The south box grants you a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Vial%20of%20Corrosive%20Blood\"><img alt=\"Vial of Corrosive Blood\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vial_of_Corrosive_Blood_acb129.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial%20of%20Corrosive%20Blood\">Vial of Corrosive Blood</a>, used to deal damage to creatures from long distance</li></ul>\n<p>Walk west along the corridor until you find a mist. You can't walk past the mist, and your goal is to kill creatures coming out of the mist trying to advance east and kill Anaztassja. Use all your resources (spells and items) to stop these creatures.\n</p><p>There are three different creatures:\n</p>\n<center>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Creature</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Minion\">Norcferatu Minion</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Minion\"><img alt=\"Norcferatu Minion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Norcferatu_Minion_4f5521.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><ul><li>The most common creature in the task</li><li>Fast creatures but easy to kill</li><li>Can be bodyblocked to delay their progress</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Abomination\">Norcferatu Abomination</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Abomination\"><img alt=\"Norcferatu Abomination\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Norcferatu_Abomination_8aa173.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><ul><li>Slower creatures but with bigger HP pool than minions</li><li>Deal more damage than minion</li><li>Cause the <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Feared Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Feared_Icon_de09fa.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Feared\">Fear</a> effect on players standing too close to it</li><li>Should be <b>prioritized</b> as their corpse grants upgrades to players' spells (make sure to step on their body after they're dead)</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Monstrosity\">Norcferatu Monstrosity</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Monstrosity\"><img alt=\"Norcferatu Monstrosity\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Norcferatu_Monstrosity_69f3af.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><ul><li>The final boss and last creature to appear in the task</li><li>Focus all damage on him as he kills Anaztassja with one hit</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</center>\n<p>Once <a href=\"#/wiki/Norcferatu%20Monstrosity\">Norcferatu Monstrosity</a> is defeated, the mission is concluded successfully.\n</p><p>Report back to Anaztassja.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Facing_the_True_Threat\">Facing the True Threat</span></h2>\n<p>Leave the current location and follow the path below to find Anaztassja again, in another location:\n</p>\n<center>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-2\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 153px; height: 153px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -817px;left:-2195px;clip:rect(817px 2348px 970px 2195px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 10\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"4096\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_10_e4e084.png\" width=\"5120\"/></span></span>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:11px; height: 11px; left:2270px; top:888px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-22px; top:-11px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"121\"/></span></span></div></div>\n<div style=\"overflow:hidden;position:absolute; width:11px; height: 11px; left:2260px; top:864px; z-index:10;\"><div style=\"position:absolute; left:-99px; top:0px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Symbols\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Symbols_48c2de.gif\" width=\"121\"/></span></span></div></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><